{"displayStem":"감염성 순환부전 환자의 치료 중 젖산 경과이다. 임상 회복과 함께 해석하려 하며 동위원소 추적이나 분포용적 측정은 시행하지 않았다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"독립 작성한 교육용 모의자료이다."}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C08 c08-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><table><thead><tr><th>시간 (h)</th><th>MAP (mmHg)</th><th>모세혈관 재충만 (s)</th><th>소변 (mL/kg/h)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>0</td><td>56</td><td>5</td><td>0.1</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>69</td><td>3</td><td>0.4</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>72</td><td>2</td><td>0.7</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>73</td><td>2</td><td>0.8</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>","<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C08 c08-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><figure class=\"c08-panel\"><figcaption>치료 중 젖산 추적</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 580 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"치료 중 젖산 추적: 관찰 (h), 젖산 (mmol/L)\"><rect width=\"580\" height=\"355\" fill=\"white\"></rect><path d=\"M76 50V235H526\" stroke=\"black\" fill=\"none\"></path><text x=\"18\" y=\"27\">젖산 (mmol/L)</text><path d=\"M76 235v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"76\" y=\"263\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><path d=\"M186 235v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"186\" y=\"263\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><path d=\"M296 235v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"296\" y=\"263\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><path d=\"M406 235v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"406\" y=\"263\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text><path d=\"M516 235v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"516\" y=\"263\" text-anchor=\"middle\">8</text><path d=\"M71 235h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"66\" y=\"241\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><path d=\"M71 191.25h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"66\" y=\"197.25\" text-anchor=\"end\">2.5</text><path d=\"M71 147.5h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"66\" y=\"153.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">5</text><path d=\"M71 103.75h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"66\" y=\"109.75\" text-anchor=\"end\">7.5</text><path d=\"M71 60h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"66\" y=\"66\" text-anchor=\"end\">10</text><polyline points=\"76,95 186,133.5 296,175.5 516,193\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-dasharray=\"none\"></polyline><circle cx=\"76\" cy=\"95\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"186\" cy=\"133.5\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"296\" cy=\"175.5\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"516\" cy=\"193\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><path d=\"M85 320h28\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-dasharray=\"none\"></path><text x=\"120\" y=\"326\">젖산</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"middle\">관찰 (h)</text></svg></figure></div></div>"]}